Rust desktop application
------------------------
The desktop shell uses direct GPUI and gpui_platform (gpui-pre 0.3.9), with
in-house widgets. It does not use GPUI Kit. Upstream GPUI software is distributed
under Apache-2.0; retain applicable upstream notices and asset-specific terms
when distributing.
  https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/tree/main/crates/gpui

Repository-owned GPUI platform and wgpu-hal patches live under vendor/.
GPUI packages are Apache-2.0; wgpu-hal is MIT OR Apache-2.0. Retain their
upstream license files and notices with distributions of the patched code.
  https://github.com/gfx-rs/wgpu

The repository-owned souvlaki media-session capability patch is under
vendor/souvlaki/. Souvlaki is MIT licensed, Copyright (c) 2021 Aldo Acevedo.
Retain vendor/souvlaki/LICENSE with distributions of this patched code.
  https://github.com/Sinono3/souvlaki

Cargo dependencies have their own licenses. This notice is not a complete
transitive dependency or bundled-asset license audit; a release must review
its actual dependency graph, assets, and distribution obligations.

